<main id="top">

  <div class="wrap hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Nevarro Technologies · Bengaluru, India</div>
    <h1>We modernize businesses in <em>deep verticals</em>.</h1>
    <p class="prose">Nevarro is a small group with two arms. One works inside established businesses — as a partner or as an owner — to modernize how they operate and expand what they earn. The other is a specialist product team building AI-native software for verticals the large platforms have never bothered with.</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:adi@nevarrotech.com?subject=Enquiry">Talk to us</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="#tracks">What we do →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="stage">
      <div class="globe-wrap" id="globeWrap" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg id="globeSvg" viewBox="0 0 660 440">
          <g id="gRingBack" transform="rotate(-16 330 220)"></g>
          <g id="gGlobe"></g>
          <g id="gRingFront" transform="rotate(-16 330 220)"></g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="stageline">
      <span>Two arms · <b>one operating philosophy</b></span>
      <span id="clock">Bengaluru · <b>--:--:--</b> IST</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="tracks"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow rev">The group</div>
    <h2 class="rev">Two arms.</h2>
    <p class="prose rev">They share a stack, a set of operating principles, and a bias toward industries that everyone else finds boring. Beyond that, they are run as separate businesses with separate clients.</p>
    <div class="tracks">
      <a class="track rev" href="/modernization">
        <div class="tnum">Arm one</div>
        <h3>Vertical Modernization</h3>
        <p>We work inside established businesses to modernize how they run — replacing manual operations with technology, expanding margins, and growing toward a defined outcome. We do this as a partner to the owner, or by acquiring the business ourselves.</p>
        <div class="tfoot"><span class="tmeta">Owners · Operators · Promoters</span><span class="tgo">Read more →</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="track rev" href="/labs">
        <div class="tnum">Arm two</div>
        <h3>Nevarro Labs</h3>
        <p>A specialist product team building AI-native software stacks for deep verticals — industry bodies, regulated professions, and enterprises whose work is specific enough that generic software has never fit. Built to order, or built as a product.</p>
        <div class="tfoot"><span class="tmeta">Enterprises · Bodies · Professions</span><span class="tgo">Read more →</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="focus"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow rev">Where we focus</div>
    <h2 class="rev">Industries with depth and inertia.</h2>
    <p class="prose rev">Sectors with real operational complexity, meaningful regulation, and software that has not kept pace — where a small team working closely with an operator can change the trajectory of the business.</p>
    <div class="lines">
      <div class="line rev"><div class="k">Healthcare</div><p>Providers and practices where operations and compliance have outgrown the systems around them.</p></div>
      <div class="line rev"><div class="k">Financial services</div><p>Intermediaries and regulated entities carrying heavy documentation and reporting obligations.</p></div>
      <div class="line rev"><div class="k">ITSM</div><p>Service management operations where volume is high, process is well defined, and the work stays manual.</p></div>
      <div class="line rev"><div class="k">Information management</div><p>Businesses whose core asset is documents and records, and whose edge is how fast they can be found and used.</p></div>
      <div class="line rev"><div class="k">Outsourcing</div><p>Delivery organisations built on people, where AI changes the economics of every process it touches.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="closing"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow rev">Ready when you are</div>
    <h2 class="rev">Tell us what you're working on.</h2>
    <p class="prose rev">Whether you run a business you want to modernize, or need software nobody has built yet, a short email is enough to start.</p>
    <div class="cta-row rev">
      <a class="btn primary" href="mailto:adi@nevarrotech.com?subject=Enquiry">Email us</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="/support">Visit support</a>
    </div>
  </div></section>

</main>

